    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Given the working definition of SMTs  (\"An SMT is any triple where if it did not exist the interaction would be undetermined.\") and[ the list of SMTs |",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1xmuzYwMn0r3p5Dgch7GX3DACftL-3nr5ImSqt_KpUbk/edit#heading=h.anvy7jtlo44h"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1xmuzYwMn0r3p5Dgch7GX3DACftL-3nr5ImSqt_KpUbk/edit#heading=h.anvy7jtlo44h",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ",]  ensure that the policy of read-only access is being enforced.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
